  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "二次審査の結果、出たんですよねっ？\r\nどうでした？　あたし、ちゃんと通ってましたかっ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900103/7009001030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは。ずっと待ってたのか？\r\n……おめでとう。二次審査も、無事通過したぞ",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "やったーっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900103/7009001030030"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "これでまた一歩、ヒーローに近づけたんですねっ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900103/7009001030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、毎日レッスンを頑張っている成果だな\r\n最近はステージも、どんどん良くなってきてるぞ",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへっ！　ありがとうございますっ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900103/7009001030050"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ヒーローだって特訓して強くなっていくんです！\r\nあたしも、強くなってきてるんですね！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900103/7009001030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、果穂は毎日強くなってるよ",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "初めてのことでも一生懸命挑戦するし、\r\nどんなことがあっても、めげずに頑張ってる",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その前向きな姿勢が、果穂を成長させてるんだ！",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへっ！\r\nヒーローは、壁に当たった時に、必ず強くなるんですっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900103/7009001030070"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "「苦難はチャンスだ！　涙は汗に変えろ！」ですっ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900103/7009001030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……よくわからないが、\r\n特撮のヒーローが言ってたセリフなんだろうな）",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな。\r\n苦しい時こそ、しっかりと力を付けなきゃな",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ。\r\n……でもっ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900103/7009001030090"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ヒーローが成長できるのは、\r\n自分だけの力じゃありませんっ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900103/7009001030100"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんが一緒だったから、\r\nあたしはどんな困難でも乗り越えてこられたんです！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900103/7009001030110"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんっ！\r\nこれからも、一緒に頑張りましょうっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900103/7009001030120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ああ！　これからもよろしくな！",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
